## 🗺️ Mission System

The game is structured as progressive cybersecurity missions:

### ✅ Mission 001 — Packet Awakening
- Introduction to packet identity
- Basic movement through nodes

### ✅ Mission 002 — Routing Basics
- Path selection mechanics
- Dead node avoidance

### ✅ Mission 003 — Phishing Awareness
- Fake nodes and spoofed routes
- Trust validation mechanics

### ✅ Mission 004 — Malware Encounter
- Infected node behavior
- Evasion mechanics

### ✅ Mission 005 — Firewall Barrier
- Permission-based navigation
- Blocked route logic

### 🔄 Mission 006 — Secure Passage Protocol
- Firewall timing patterns
- Secure tunneling introduction

### 🚧 Mission 007 — Source Tracking Protocol
- Identify compromised origins
- Early threat intelligence mechanics

